<title>FINLAND: FINNISH SEPT CONSTRUCTION COSTS FALL 0.9 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH SEPT CONSTRUCTION COSTS FALL 0.9 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish construction costs fell 0.9 percent year-on-year in September afer a 0.9 percent fall in August, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The construction cost index (1995=100) was unchanged from August and stood at 99.2 in September, it said.</p>
</text>
